include LICENSE
include README.md
include AGENTS.md
include pyproject.toml

# 白名单，不用 graft：sdist 自足性靠"解包即用"验证（M6）。
# README 的每条命令都得在解包树里敲得通：示例输入（"用法"一节）、fixture 清单
# （`gen_fixtures.py --check` 与 `tests/test_fixtures.py`）、CI 工作流
# （`check_ci_workflow.py`）三者缺一个，解包树里就会红（M6 解包实测 12 failed + 2 门红）。
recursive-include examples *.json
include fixtures/manifest.json
recursive-include .github *.yml
recursive-include src/bpreflight/data *.json
# M1 内嵌官方字典：正文 + 上游许可 + 来源声明（缺一个就违反 Apache-2.0 的归属要求）。
recursive-include src/bpreflight/data/gs1-syntax-dictionary *.txt LICENSE NOTICE

include plan/*.md
include data/README.md
include tools/*.py
